r the ultimate experience, launder your pillowcases using regular wash and short dry cycles. You can resist wrinkles by removing your pillow protectors from the dryer right after the cycle has ended  ','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Feather-Stitch-2-Piece-Pillowcase-Set-Standard-Size-White-100-Cotton-Damask-Stripe-Pillow-Cases-500-Thread-Count-20x30-Inches-Ultra-Soft-Luxury-Satee_b7c5a6c6-2a1a-4484-9ea4-87b4d8b2761b.df4035b1e5d6cb9c511de71ad1d78587.jpeg','Pillowcases',24.99,33700,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Feather-Stitch-2-Piece-Pillowcase-Set-Standard-Size-White-100-Cotton-Damask-Stripe-Pillow-Cases-500-Thread-Count-20x30-Inches-Ultra-Soft-Luxury-Satee/1097677016',true),
  ('walmart-csv:973604797','walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1',array['R2','R3']::text[],'Gallery Solutions 8"x10" Black Wall Mount/Tabletop Picture Frame - Perfect Fit for 5"x7" Photos - Versatile Mounting Options','갤러리 솔루션 8×10 검정 사진 액자','   VERSATILITY: Introducing the Black 8x10 tabletop or wall frame, a versatile piece that effortlessly enhances your décor with its timeless elegance. Featuring a contrasting double white mat opening meticulously crafted for your 5x7 image, this frame offers a striking visual appeal that draws attention to your cherished memories or artwork. Whether displayed on a tabletop or mounted on a wall, its sleek and sturdy design ensures stability and durability.   ELEVATE YOUR ARTWORK: With the new heights with the Airfloat mat, designed to enhance depth and dimension in a captivating manner. This innovative feature creates a striking shadow effect by incorporating a separated double mat, adding a dynamic visual element that draws the viewer''s attention. Crafted with precision, the Airfloat mat ensures that your art stands out in any setting, commanding admiration and intrigue.   EFFORTLESS DISPLAY: With the frame''s thoughtful inclusion of both a two-way easel and hanging hardware on the back. This versatile design ensures seamless presentation options, whether you prefer to showcase your artwork on a tabletop or hang it securely on a wall. The two-way easel provides stability and flexibility, allowing you to adjust the angle for optimal viewing. Meanwhile, the integrated hanging hardware simplifies the mounting process.   CONVENIENCE: Versatility meets convenience with the photo frame''s ability to be displayed vertically or horizontally, offering flexibility to suit your preferences and space constraints effortlessly. Whether you''re showcasing a portrait or a landscape-oriented image, this frame seamlessly adapts to accommodate your desired orientation, ensuring optimal presentation for any photo. Its adaptable design makes it a versatile addition to any room, allowing you to effortlessly switch between display.   DURABILITY: Indulge in the durability and convenience of the frame, meticulously crafted from solid wood to ensure lasting quality and timeless appeal. Its robust construction not only provides a sturdy foundation for your cherished photos but also adds a touch of sophistication to any space. The frame''s easy-open tabs on the back make loading your photos a breeze, eliminating the hassle of struggling with intricate fastenings.  ','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Gallery-Solutions-8-x10-Wall-Mount-Tabletop-Picture-Frame-for-5-x7-Photos-Black_81b98612-bccf-46e1-a1df-d3f71c0a901f.90be35080d5e69b17e1d9863275414de.jpeg','Picture Frames Shop All',15.00,20300,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Gallery-Solutions-8-x10-Wall-Mount-Tabletop-Picture-Frame-for-5-x7-Photos-Black/973604797',true),
  ('walmart-csv:3511393855','walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1',array['R2','R3']::text[],'Luxe Weavers Modern Abstract Beige 2x3 Area Rug, Stain Resistant Carpet','럭스 위버스 베이지 2×3 러그','Luxe Weavers Euston Collection Modern Area Rug has an abstract pattern with shades of cream that complements both contemporary and traditional home d&eacute;cor. Our area rugs are soft and safe for kids and pets to lounge on in living rooms and playrooms. Machine woven rugs with a medium pile height and stain-resistant properties. Redefine bedrooms and dining rooms with the artistic distressed design and soothing color combinations. Choose small rug sizes like 2x3 and 4x5 for entryways and large rug sizes 8x10 or 9x12 for living rooms or family rooms. Constructed from 100% polypropylene materials with jute backing, this rug is easy to clean and made to last.','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Luxe-Weavers-Modern-Abstract-Beige-2x3-Area-Rug-Stain-Resistant-Carpet_e3d4e24b-6e66-4f91-9f13-ac86479b2b55.a76a52fc5aee59e6973c72679fb78754.jpeg','All Area Rugs',25.00,33800,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Luxe-Weavers-Modern-Abstract-Beige-2x3-Area-Rug-Stain-Resistant-Carpet/3511393855',true),
  ('walmart-csv:10308385','walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1',array['R4']::text[],'OLD BAY Gluten Free Classic Seafood Seasoning, 6 oz Can','올드 베이 클래식 시푸드 시즈닝 6oz','OLD BAY Gluten Free Classic Seafood Seasoning, 6 oz Can. There are two things you need to know about OLD BAY Seasoning: 1. It’s great on seafood. 2. It’s great on everything else! OLD BAY’s unique blend of 18 herbs and spices was born along the Chesapeake Bay over 75 years ago. Today, it’s won over hearts (and mouths!) across the USA. Marylanders can’t imagine crab without it. They’re shaking and stirring it straight into low country boils down south, and all around the country, folks are getting creative, pairing OLD BAY with pizza, popcorn, donuts, veggies, burgers and fries to name a few. This OLD BAY Classic Seafood Seasoning is in a Plastic can that is 6 ounces. Store this shelf-stable item at an ambient temperature.','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/OLD-BAY-Kosher-Classic-Seafood-Seasoning-6-oz-Can_65a33fb4-d35f-4a1d-9d90-2dda3ccb8a8d.d9c05f29528c682bc64ffc59c4cdf4d7.jpeg','Seasoning mixes & blends',4.43,6000,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/OLD-BAY-Kosher-Classic-Seafood-Seasoning-6-oz-Can/10308385',true),
  ('walmart-csv:36995775','walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1',array['R4']::text[],'Dash Original Seasoning Blend, Salt free, 21 oz','대시 오리지널 무염 시즈닝 21oz','Dash Salt-Free Original Seasoning Blend 21 oz bottle helps you make cooking delicious again. This salt free seasoning blend is an all-purpose mix of herbs and spices that is easy to love and simple to pair with almost anything. The flavor of this no salt seasoning blend is created by mixing over 14 different spices together, including cayenne pepper, cumin, basil, and garlic. Dash Salt Free Original Seasoning is kosher so you can enjoy a delicious meal without skipping out on taste. This Dash salt free seasoning is perfect for bringing instant flavor and a little bit of spice to your favorite meats, vegetables, sauces, and more. Smarter cooking is simple with this Dash seasoning mix. Dash salt-free seasoning mix makes a flavorful statement.','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dash-Original-Seasoning-Blend-Salt-free-21-oz_28115456-d416-4be4-9b81-175844b5cb75.42ebdff81053a3c2f4c3ab0270514de2.jpeg','Seasoning mixes & blends',13.12,17700,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Dash-Original-Seasoning-Blend-Salt-free-21-oz/36995775',true),
  ('walmart-csv:14123516','walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1',array['R4']::text[],'Ragu Chunky Garden Pasta Sauce with Tomatoes, Onions, Celery, Carrots, Zucchini, Green Bell Peppers, 24 oz','라구 청키 가든 파스타 소스 24oz','   One 24 oz jar of Ragu Chunky Garden Combination Pasta Sauce with Diced Tomatoes, Onions, Celery, Carrots, Zucchini, and Green Bell Peppers   Pasta sauce that stays close to the roots - Made with chopped vegetables that you can see for a well-balanced texture and flavor, this red sauce is brimming with vine-ripened tomatoes, onions, celery, carrots, zucchini, and green bell peppers   Quality ingredients, delicious taste - Red pasta sauce made from an authentic recipe with high quality ingredients to create a tomato sauce that is perfect for weeknight family dinners   Make easy, Italian-inspired dinners - Ragu sauce brings flavor and quality so you can create delicious Italian family meals in minutes   Versatile Italian flavor - Use this chunky garden tomato pasta sauce to create dishes like vegetable pasta primavera, veggie lasagna or add to cooked noodles as a traditional spaghetti sauce   Endless recipes - Create mouthwatering meals you and your family with love like stuffed shells with ricotta cheese or pasta primavera   Crafted with Passion since 1937 - Trusted for over 80 years to bring families together at the table, Ragu pasta sauces are ideal for family dinners  ','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ragu-Chunky-Garden-Pasta-Sauce-with-Tomatoes-Onions-Celery-Carrots-Zucchini-Green-Bell-Peppers-24-oz_553f1043-244f-433b-9e86-1ddd165dc991.63b208cb9e130f7a3503061122a7457d.jpeg','Pantry staples',2.24,3000,'USD 1 = KRW 1350; nearest KRW 100; source CSV 2024-08-24/25','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Ragu-Chunky-Garden-Pasta-Sauce-with-Tomatoes-Onions-Celery-Carrots-Zucchini-Green-Bell-Peppers-24-oz/14123516',true)
on conflict (source_product_id) do nothing;

-- Candidate exposure begins only when all three cards are displayed. If preparation
-- itself never succeeds, end the waiting trial after 180 wall-clock seconds so the
-- participant can record it as incomplete and continue. Waiting is not exposure.
create or replace function public.study_ping(p_trial_id uuid,p_tab_id text,p_sequence bigint,p_active boolean)
returns jsonb language plpgsql security definer set search_path=public as $$
declare t public.study_trials%rowtype; now_at timestamptz:=clock_timestamp();
  delta_ms integer:=0; total integer; waiting_ms bigint;
begin
  select * into t from public.study_trials where id=p_trial_id for update;
  if t.id is null or t.phase not in ('candidates','decision') then raise exception 'PHASE_NOT_ACTIVE'; end if;
  if t.phase='candidates' and t.candidate_builder='agent' and t.candidates_visible_at is null then
    if t.phase_started_at is null then
      update public.study_trials set phase_started_at=now_at where id=t.id;
      t.phase_started_at:=now_at;
    end if;
    waiting_ms:=greatest(0,floor(extract(epoch from(now_at-t.phase_started_at))*1000)::bigint);
    if waiting_ms>=180000 then
      update public.study_trials set phase='timeout',timed_out_at=now_at,
        timeout_phase='candidates',operator_review_needed=true,updated_at=now_at where id=t.id;
      insert into public.study_events(person_id,trial_id,role,condition,order_position,phase,actor,origin,event_type,payload)
      values(t.person_id,t.id,t.role,t.condition,t.order_position,'candidates','system','system','phase_timeout',
        jsonb_build_object('effective_ms',0,'preparation_wait_ms',waiting_ms,
          'reason','candidate_preparation_timeout','missing_candidate_count',3));
      return jsonb_build_object('accepted',true,'effective_ms',0,'phase','timeout',
        'waiting_for_candidates',true,'preparation_wait_ms',waiting_ms);
    end if;
    return jsonb_build_object('accepted',true,'effective_ms',0,'phase','candidates',
      'waiting_for_candidates',true,'preparation_wait_ms',waiting_ms);
  end if;
  if p_sequence<=t.phase_ping_sequence then return jsonb_build_object('accepted',false,'effective_ms',t.phase_effective_ms,'phase',t.phase); end if;
  if t.active_tab_lease_until>now_at and t.active_tab_id is distinct from p_tab_id then raise exception 'OTHER_TAB_ACTIVE'; end if;
  if p_active and t.phase_last_ping_at is not null and t.active_tab_id=p_tab_id then
    delta_ms:=greatest(0,floor(extract(epoch from(now_at-t.phase_last_ping_at))*1000)::integer);
    if delta_ms>5000 then delta_ms:=0; end if;
  end if;
  total:=least(180000,t.phase_effective_ms+delta_ms);
  update public.study_trials set
    phase_started_at=case when p_active then coalesce(phase_started_at,now_at) else phase_started_at end,
    phase_effective_ms=total,phase_last_ping_at=case when p_active then now_at else null end,
    phase_ping_sequence=p_sequence,active_tab_id=case when p_active then p_tab_id else null end,
    active_tab_lease_until=case when p_active then now_at+interval '12 seconds' else null end,
    phase=case when total>=180000 then 'timeout' else phase end,
    timed_out_at=case when total>=180000 then now_at else timed_out_at end,
    timeout_phase=case when total>=180000 then phase else timeout_phase end,
    operator_review_needed=case when total>=180000 then true else operator_review_needed end,
    updated_at=now_at where id=t.id;
  if total>=180000 then
    insert into public.study_events(person_id,trial_id,role,condition,order_position,phase,actor,origin,event_type,payload)
    values(t.person_id,t.id,t.role,t.condition,t.order_position,t.phase,'system','system','phase_timeout',
      jsonb_build_object('effective_ms',total,'missing_candidate_count',3-jsonb_array_length(t.candidate_snapshots),'has_final',t.final_product_id is not null));
  end if;
  return jsonb_build_object('accepted',true,'effective_ms',total,'phase',case when total>=180000 then 'timeout' else t.phase end);
end; $$;
commit;

-- Confirm the seed before running the study. This SELECT is read only.
select source_product_id,name_ko,price_krw,profile_codes from public.study_products where dataset_version='walmart-csv-2024-08-study-nine-v1' order by source_product_id;
